WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.060
[Anxious Pulsing Synth Bass and Rising Digital Whine Intro]

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.042
Driving north on 81, the autumn leaves are golden red

00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:32.063
My family is all around me, trying to clear my head

00:00:32.103 --> 00:00:36.945
We're headed for the Parkway, just a perfect normal day

00:00:37.025 --> 00:00:41.607
Then we hit the sign at Lexington, the gauntlet's underway

00:00:41.747 --> 00:00:46.500
The ghost is in the car again, the ghost is in the lane

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Two blue shields side by side, her voice is in my brain

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.500
I-64, the eastbound sign, and 81 the north

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:05.545
I know the exit's 81, but her road is pulling forth

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:10.330
This is the thirty-mile gauntlet, I'm holding on so tight

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:16.134
I'm trying to be normal, I'm trying to win the fight

00:01:16.514 --> 00:01:22.000
But every sign is like a gun, a reminder of her trap

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.304
I'm just a passenger caught in the big green map

00:01:29.304 --> 00:01:35.800
[Driving Synth-Rock Interlude]

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:41.000
We're getting close to Staunton now, the split is coming fast

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.746
Exit 221, a test I have to pass

00:01:46.786 --> 00:01:51.509
Mark just asked me, "Are you ready?" I look him in the eye

00:01:52.109 --> 00:01:57.012
I have to face this demon, "I'm ready, I will try"

00:01:57.052 --> 00:02:02.500
We're on the ramp, the turn is made, a sign for Richmond East

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:08.500
The world just stops, the light just fades, the monster is unleashed

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.560
It's her road, it's her prison, it's the place I cannot be

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:19.182
Get me off! Get me off! She's coming, she's got me!

00:02:19.182 --> 00:02:43.236
[Chaotic Industrial Overload]

00:02:43.236 --> 00:02:48.118
SYSTEM CRASH! I-64!

00:02:50.279 --> 00:02:58.884
THAT IS NOT MY NAME! SYSTEM CRASH! SHE'S AT THE DOOR!

00:03:01.749 --> 00:03:07.051
SHE'S WON THE GAME! I CAN'T BREATHE, I CAN'T SEE!

00:03:07.351 --> 00:03:16.415
GET ME OUT, GET ME FREE! NO! NO! NO! NO!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:32.080
Exit 91...
